NUMA AND PCIe OBSERVATIONS
--------------------------
1. All CPUs, host memory and GPU endpoints are on NUMA node 0. There is no cross-NUMA path in this configuration.
2. GPU0 is negotiated at PCIe 32 GT/s x16, indicating the expected full-width link.
3. ASPM is disabled, which is favorable for a low-latency measurement.
4. Direct H2D and copy-engine H2D results are consistent: 56.18, 56.29 and 56.24 GB/s.
5. The measured H2D values are approximately 89% of the nominal 63 GB/s PCIe reference and exceed configured thresholds.

